# IFOS software catalog — Audio, video and graphics
VLC|Plays essentially any media file|vlc|repo
mpv|Minimal, scriptable video player|mpv|repo
GIMP|Raster image editor|gimp|repo
Inkscape|Vector graphics editor|inkscape|repo
Krita|Digital painting|krita|repo
Blender|3D modelling, animation and rendering|blender|repo
Audacity|Audio recording and editing|audacity|repo
Kdenlive|Non-linear video editor|kdenlive|repo
HandBrake|Video transcoder|handbrake|repo
Spotify|Music streaming|spotify|aur
Codecs|GStreamer plugins for extra formats|gst-plugins-good gst-plugins-bad gst-plugins-ugly gst-libav|repo
